Package: transformeRs
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by Generation 1 Transformers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Maitner", , "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes based on the original 1984-1988 Generation 1
    Transformers toys: Optimus Prime, Megatron, and every member and combined
    form of the core combiner teams (Aerialbots, Protectobots, Technobots,
    Constructicons, Stunticons, Combaticons, Terrorcons, Predacons and
    Seacons). Includes ggplot2 colour and fill scales for discrete and
    continuous data, team palettes that take one colour from each member of a
    combiner team, metadata linking each palette to its character, faction,
    team and reference page, and helpers to shortlist palettes that suit
    categorical, colour-blind-safe, sequential or diverging use. Hex values
    are approximations of the toys' plastic and paint colours; transformeRs
    is a fan project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Hasbro or
    Takara Tomy.
